# Rural ERides GO — Public Release Configuration
#
# All private third-party API keys have been removed from client-side BuildConfig
# so this app can be published and shared publicly with zero credential exposure.
#
# Active Live Backends (Keyless / App Check Protected):
# - AI Co-Pilot, Mechanic Vision & Search Grounding: Firebase AI Logic + App Check
# - Cloud Auth, Database, Board, Radar, DMs & Calls: Firebase Auth + Cloud Firestore
# - Maps, Routing, Speed Limits & Chargers: OpenStreetMap + OSRM + Nominatim + Overpass
# - Weather, Elevation & Storm Radar: Open-Meteo + Open-Elevation + RainViewer
# - Video & PEV News Feeds: YouTube Live RSS + Electrek PEV RSS
